  (removed from /status/data JSON, the monitor page and the status page DOM)
- Rebuild monitor detail, incidents list and incident detail pages; drop public admin link
- Help center: remove invented 24/7 / instant-setup claims, use real Discord setting
- docs/STAGING_CHECKLIST.md: step-by-step verification for every critical path
